WEBVTT

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:02.600
This is the reason we are all here.

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:06.980
With a network of businesses, people and nonprofits that actually show up,

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:10.200
we can run campaigns that move the needle for the animals.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:13.940
The Directory's Community section lists nonprofits,

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:16.880
rescues and sanctuaries in every chapter.

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:21.260
Every city has a Fosters board and a Rescues board,

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:23.300
so animals find help close by.

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:26.600
Events has sanctuary days and fundraisers,

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:29.980
and every morning the Daily Pulse has news for the animals.

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:34.500
You can give your points to a nonprofit, rescue or sanctuary,

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:35.840
right from its page.

00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:37.240
We want to hear from you.

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:40.700
As a member, you shape what we take on together:

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:44.580
tell us which causes matter most to you, post on the boards,

00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:47.060
and let us know if something needs to be fixed.

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:48.420
Membership is free.

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:52.140
We ask for a short survey so we know real people are joining,

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:54.520
and that keeps this community worth your time.

00:00:55.220 --> 00:00:56.340
Bring people with you:

00:00:56.480 --> 00:01:00.320
invite your friends, your community, new Vegans and Pre-Vegans.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:03.400
And you earn points for everybody who joins using your link.

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:07.200
That is the easiest way to grow your experience and open new doors in our

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:07.760
community.

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:10.280
Show up for the animals today.

